ues, requests for Claude).\n\nI won't touch `tasks/NEXT.md`, `tasks/backlog/`, `docs/`, `.clinerules/` or `.cline-runs/`. `src/server/ai.ts` and the database store are left for T1–T3.\n\n## Commands (PowerShell, run from `C:\\Dev\\cline hackathon\\build`)\n```powershell\ngit init -b main\nnpx create-next-app@16.4.0 \"$env:TEMP\\kc-scaffold\" --ts --tailwind --eslint --app --src-dir --import-alias \"@/*\" --use-npm --no-turbopack --yes --skip-install\n# copy everything except node_modules/.git into this folder; nothing existing gets overwritten\nrobocopy \"$env:TEMP\\kc-scaffold\" . /E /XD node_modules .git /XC /XN /XO\nnpm install\nnpm install zod\nnpm install -D vitest fast-check\nnpm test            # vitest run\nnpm run typecheck   # tsc --noEmit\nnpm run lint        # eslint .\nnpm run build"}}
